:: JobsTeacher
<<scenery Directoroom>>
You are sitting in the office of the school principal, Mr. Smith. He looks at you with interest and says:

M. Smith : Hello, $player.name. Thank you for coming today for this interview.
We have received your application for the position of professor and we are delighted to meet you.


$player.name: Hello, Mr. Smith. It's a pleasure to be here.
Mr. Smith: Okay, let's talk about your experience and qualifications.


[Discussion continues...]

Finally, after extensive discussion, Mr. Smith said:

M. Smith : $player.name, we are impressed by your experience and passion for teaching.
We would like to offer you the position of teacher at our school.



<<keyOption [[Accept the offer|acceptJobs]] ✅>>
<<keyOption [[Refuse the offer|refuseJobs]] ❌>>


:: acceptJobs
<<scenery Directoroom>>

<<set $job = "teacher">>

<<for _jobKey, _job range Jobs>>
    <<set $player.job = _job>> // Définit le travail du joueur sur l'emploi sélectionné
    <<dialog "Changement de poste">>
        Votre poste est maintenant : <<print _job.name.toUpperFirst()>>.
    <</dialog>>
    <<goto "Eshool">> // Redirigez le joueur vers le passage approprié
<</for>>


:: refuseJobs
<<scenery Directoroom>>

You thank the manager for the opportunity, but you decide not to take the job.
you left the principal's office.

<<keyOption [[Leave the principal's office|Eshool]] 🚪>>
